412
00:21:54.209 --> 00:21:56.006
Jadi, sebaliknya, kita akan bertindak seperti Cardassians.

413
00:21:56.045 --> 00:21:57.410
Mudah dan besar.

414
00:21:57.446 --> 00:21:58.743
